  "author": "James",
  "version": "2026-09-rala-p2c",
  "description": "RALA ramp biased to the 2026-09-21 RadarScope still (Johnson City / Dripping Springs / San Marcos). Continuous RGB+alpha interpolation, not nearest 5 dBZ steps. Low end is dark green (the RadarScope bar), then neon green, James yellow, a wide orange, red, and hot magenta/pink cores. Weak valid returns stay visible with a gentle alpha ramp. No cyan/aqua band. No-echo and missing stay alpha 0. No hard <15 cutoff. Composite keeps mpwg-clean-2026-09.",
  "units": "dBZ",
  "display_min_dbz": -32,
  "below_min": [0, 0, 0, 0],
